data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"The user wants a title for a conversation where the main task is to read a campaign config file, read input files, process a specific dispatch (d002), and then reply using a command. Need to focus on main topic/question. The user message is an instruction. Key elements: cs-campaign, dispatch d002, read config and inputs, follow d002.md, reply with command. Title should be brief ≤50 chars, same language (English), grammatically correct, no tool names, no \"summarizing/generating\", remove articles, no tech stack assumptions. Need to avoid including tool names? \"Read\" is not a tool name here. The task is campaign dispatch d002. Maybe title: \"Campaign dispatch d002: read config, inputs, reply\" or \"Process cs-campaign dispatch d002 and reply\". Let's craft under 50 chars. \"Process cs-campaign dispatch d002 and reply\" = 42 chars. Good. Could also \"cs-campaign dispatch d002 execution and reply\" 45. Need no articles. \"Process\" okay. The examples show titles like \"Debugging production 500 errors\". Use action. Title: \"Process cs-campaign dispatch d002 and reply\". That captures reading config/inputs and reply. Ensure no \"the\". Good."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789849045,"id":"chatcmpl-5d7f0a39ca7748318671ffad31fe1b04","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

